 by tons  of casts their production team made  welcome to madrapore the land of small  alleys of a small town  in georgia with a bit of vietnam and  mozambique that is why we're going to  madrid  what's up with madjapur after spending  loads of time finding the perfect place  to shoot puerto rico was the answer  until there were two earthquakes and  their plan had to change  after regrouping and choosing new spots  to shoot they chose to venture to prague  the team flew out and had an amazing  week of mesmerizing locations and  exciting scenes but then  the pandemic really got out of hand and  the production had to shut down  immediately  literally a day after a hundred people  were flown back to the u.s  of course this really threw a wrench in  the plans and production had to stop  completely for many months  when the time came to finish the series  they knew they had to go back to prague  to get more shots but  of course it wasn't going to be so easy  considering they had to rearrange their  schedule  and account for the fact that people  couldn't fly back and forth so easily  not to mention they had to convince the  government in prague to allow a huge  american movie crew into the country to  film  thanks to the stellar crew and super  skilled writers they pulled off the feet  and managed to bring the series to our  screens at home  all while making sure every person  involved was safe and taken care of  the final result is pretty impressive  especially considering all they went  through while shooting  steve knew me longer and he had a plan  their names are in the title of the show  so we got to spend plenty of times with  bucky and sam  and are we ever glad we did the two of  them brought such a great friendship to  the screen and we loved really getting  to know who they were and watching their  relationship grow  especially considering their tents  passed as we can see here they  definitely look like they're having a  good time together and that chemistry  comes across  on screen too for anthony mackie the  experience working on the show was  really significant  especially because of the representation  of what it's like to be a black man in  america  they really address what carrying on the  legacy of captain america and being  decorated in those stars and stripes  would mean for him and his community  we are definitely hoping to see more of  these too soon  enjoy your ride buck no no you can't  call me that  marvel has done it again while it didn't  totally blow us away after seeing  wandavision  we're really glad that the mcu series  are continuing we were so excited to  finally see these two  totally underrated characters in the  spotlights which mcu  side character would you like to see  more of how did you feel about this show  compared to wandavision  you
 

